      "subtitle": "Daily Soothing Toner for balanced hydration & skin texture\n\nSoothing stressed skin and improves skin texture, transforming it into a glowing complexion\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT SOOTHING FACE TONER:\nFor sebum care, Flawless skin, it provides excellent soothing and skin texture improvement with a non-sticky finish to\nachieve glass skin.\n\nEXOSOME CICA:\nMedicube's Exosome Cica is developed in a nano size that is 1/510 smaller than pores, delivering 5.3 times more powerful\nskin texture improvement and soothing effects than traditional Cica.\n\nKEY INGREDIENTS:\nExosome Cica, formulated in a nano size smaller than pores, is effective for soothing and improving skin texture.\nHeartleaf and tea tree, it's low irritating and is effective in balancing oil and moisture while providing hydration.\n\nFOR ALL SKIN TYPES:\nWith low-irritating ingredients, it provides a clear and even skin tone while hydrating the skin, making it suitable for all skin types.\n\nDaily use without artificial colors or fragrances: This toner is the perfect combination with any product, enhancing\nyour skincare routine and addressing any skin concerns to help you achieve your best skin yet\n\n*Results may vary depending on individual skin types.\n\n*Clinical Trial Tested by 'ICBIO Co., Ltd'",
