      "subtitle": "Introducing Deep Vita C Pads, a game-changing addition to your skincare\nroutine, specially crafted to address the distinctive needs of both\nacne-prone and dull skin.\n\nOver a 4-week period, a remarkable *100% of participants witnessed\nimprovements in pigmentation, dark spots, exfoliation, hydration, and\nskin radiance.\n\nPowered by a potent blend of key ingredients, including Sea Buckthorn\nExtract renowned for its rich vitamin C content, Deep Vita C Pads\nactively help to improve post-acne marks, dark spots, and even out your\nskin tone. Notably, the vibrant yellow color of these pads comes\nnaturally from the sea buckthorn extract, ensuring a visually appealing\nand wholesome product.\n\nElevate your skincare routine and experience with the transformative\npower of Deep Vita C Pads. Unveil a brighter, more radiant complexion\nwhile enjoying the added benefit of improved post-acne marks. Rediscover\nconfidence in your skin and embrace the radiance you deserve.\n\nVegan Verified\n\nNon-comedogenic\n\nDermatologist-tested\n\nTested to be Low-Irritating\n\nph 3.5-5.5\n\nNo artificial color\n\nSustainable Packaging\n\n*Excerpt from Medicube Deep Vita C Pads Test Report and Survey\n\n*Results may vary.\n\nNet wt. 5.29 oz. / 150g (70 pads)",
